# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Docker build context exclusions.
#
# The first two blocks are the important ones: citizen data and credentials
# must never enter an image layer, because a layer is permanent and an image
# gets pushed to a registry.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Citizen data. NEVER build this into an image. -------------------------
#
# backend/var holds sessions.sqlite (the whole petition: name, address,
# Aadhaar number, grievance), the generated DOCX/PDF, and everything a citizen
# uploaded as an attachment. It is mounted as a volume at runtime instead.
var/
backend/var/
**/var/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.db

# --- Credentials. -----------------------------------------------------------
#
# Nothing resembling an environment file may reach a layer. Runtime
# configuration is injected by docker-compose env_file from a host file that
# is never part of the build context.
# backend/.env.example is excluded too. It is committed documentation, but it
# has drifted from backend/app/config.py (it still specifies the retired
# SARVAM_TTS_MODEL=bulbul:v2 / speaker anushka, which answer HTTP 400), so it
# must never be a template anyone copies inside a running container.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# --- Version control and CI/deployment scaffolding --------------------------
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
deploy/
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
sonar-project.properties

# --- Python caches and local environments -----------------------------------
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.venv/
venv/
backend/.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/

# --- Tests are not needed at runtime ----------------------------------------
#
# backend/scripts IS kept: verify_pdf.py (the nine-check PDF/Tamil validation
# that gates pdf_production_ready) and ingest.py (loads the government corpus)
# are operational tools that are run inside the container.
backend/tests/

# --- Documentation ----------------------------------------------------------
docs/
README.md
backend/README.md
*.md

# --- Editor and OS leftovers ------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
